{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In the first month</b> This is juxtaposed to the section of the red heifer because in the first [month] the heifer was burned, and also as the Sages expounded that the death of the righteous atones like the heifer. פרה אדומה — red heifer — in gematria is מכפר — atones." "<b>And Miriam died there and was buried there</b> שם — there — in gematria is מכפר — atones. שם — there — in gematria is אסור בהנאה — forbidden for benefit — it is."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:34.255959431Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}